{"product_id":"vc50-blue-vacuum-roller-brush","title":"Buture Roller Brush for VC50 Blue Vacuum","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTips: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe VC50 Blue Vacuum Cleaner has been upgraded since 2024. We recommend buying a set of floor brushes and roller brushes to avoid incompatibility issues.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTwo Types of VC50 Roller Brushes: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHard Brush is more suitable for carpets clean. Soft Brush is more suitable for floors clean.\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"1 piece \/ Hard brush","offer_id":46235900477695,"sku":"VC50BGSY","price":20.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"1 piece \/ Soft brush","offer_id":46661532352767,"sku":"VC50BGSR","price":20.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"1 Floor Brush + 1 Roller Brush \/ Hard brush","offer_id":46295554490623,"sku":"VC50BDS1GSY1","price":55.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"1 Floor Brush + 1 Roller Brush \/ Soft brush","offer_id":46661532385535,"sku":"VC50BDS1GSR1","price":55.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/1e90bf50ff2db91079b1e4263aa3f0a2.jpg?v=1742802764","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/vc50-blue-vacuum-roller-brush","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}